wix-export/pattern-1-landing.html:356:  <section id="services"><div class="wrap"><div class="services-head"><div class="section-tag mono">- 08 / Commercial Services</div><h2 class="section-title">Beyond <em>headshots</em>.</h2><p class="section-intro">Commercial services for institutions, agencies, and brands needing visual production at scale.</p></div><div class="proof-row"><div class="proof-item"><strong>HBO</strong><span class="mono">Warner Media Aerial Footage</span></div><div class="proof-item"><strong>The CW</strong><span class="mono">Regional DP Credit</span></div><div class="proof-item"><strong>Nat Geo</strong><span class="mono">Commercial Drone Production</span></div></div><div class="service-row"><div class="service-num mono">01 -</div><div class="service-name">Architecture <em>& Interiors</em></div><div class="service-desc">Commercial architecture, interior design, hospitality photography, and real estate imagery for architects, developers, and design firms. Pricing is structured around a creative fee plus post-production, with licensing included for standard professional use and cost-sharing available for additional project partners. <a href="architecture.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Explore the portfolio</a> or view the <a href="architectural-photographer-el-paso.html" style="color:var(--accent)">architectural photography service page</a>.</div><div class="service-price mono"><span class="label">Typical 8-image project from</span> $1,470</div></div><div class="service-row"><div class="service-num mono">02 -</div><div class="service-name">Brand & <em>Editorial</em></div><div class="service-desc">Full-production commercial campaigns with talent direction, lighting, cinematography, and FAA-certified aerial work for brands, publications, and agencies. See <a href="el-paso-commercial-photographer.html" style="color:var(--accent)">commercial photography</a>, <a href="drone-photography-el-paso.html" style="color:var(--accent)">drone production</a>, and <a href="blog.html" style="color:var(--accent)">visual strategy articles</a>.</div><div class="service-price mono"><span class="label">From</span> $3,500</div></div></div></section>
